    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not your typical monster collector!<br>A Unique (async) <strong><u>PVP</u>/<u>PVE</u></strong> \u00a0Experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! Do you love relics? Yeah I thought so... We LOVE relics. <strong>NikNaks</strong> are relics that can fight!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NikNaks</strong> are effective both ON and OFF the field! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/05e21f9fe9c29a2795648772d2fa5455.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=800 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/05e21f9fe9c29a2795648772d2fa5455.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>INSANE</strong> COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Select your <u><strong>GOD</strong></u> at the start of each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Reorder your hand to cheat out crazy effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Draft Niknaks that synergize well with one another to build the best team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Stack niknaks together to create powerhouse builds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022After <strong>each battle</strong> get a chance to draft new <strong>teammates</strong>,  and other <strong><strong>upgrades</strong></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Multiple zones, each with its own theme, rewards,  and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/597ed7278a961617ad298b257b08dc9b.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=800 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/597ed7278a961617ad298b257b08dc9b.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in creating this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/a061e81fea0e873e6ac4856f927524a8.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not your typical monster collector!<br>A Unique (async) <strong><u>PVP</u>/<u>PVE</u></strong> \u00a0Experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! Do you love relics? Yeah I thought so... We LOVE relics. <strong>NikNaks</strong> are relics that can fight!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NikNaks</strong> are effective both ON and OFF the field! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/05e21f9fe9c29a2795648772d2fa5455.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=800 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/05e21f9fe9c29a2795648772d2fa5455.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/29e370debd9d1f7cdb90b42888b3e003.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>INSANE</strong> COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Select your <u><strong>GOD</strong></u> at the start of each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Reorder your hand to cheat out crazy effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Draft Niknaks that synergize well with one another to build the best team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Stack niknaks together to create powerhouse builds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/4194a081014e2d97daaf987ef0cedcf3.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022After <strong>each battle</strong> get a chance to draft new <strong>teammates</strong>,  and other <strong><strong>upgrades</strong></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Multiple zones, each with its own theme, rewards,  and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/597ed7278a961617ad298b257b08dc9b.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=800 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/597ed7278a961617ad298b257b08dc9b.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.poster.avif?t=1743727307\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.webm?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038530/extras/67e3f685f1ea48925f54f9ac2d4c8a3e.mp4?t=1743727307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in creating this game.</p>",
